{"id":"P094-2","subject":"P","unit":"P094","unitTitle":"2025 ② (5월~8월) · 25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 1~50문항","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P094-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n500kVA, 3000/200V 단상 변압기의 1차 환산 임피\n\n던스가 Ω일 때, %리액턴스 강하는?\n\n\n① 0.83         ② 1.25\n\n③ 1.67         ④ 2.12\n\n⑤ 2.63","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m26-q.webp","width":696,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m26-e1.webp","width":678,"height":400},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m26-e2.webp","width":696,"height":785}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n동기 조상기에서 출력과 역률이 일정하도록 조정한 다음에\n\n계자전류를 조정할 때 나타나는 현상은?\n\n\n① 계자전류는 인덕턴스와 관계되므로, 인덕턴스가 변화한다.\n\n② 주파수와 인덕턴스가 변화하며, 이로인해 역률이 변화\n\n  한다.\n\n③ 역률의 변화없이 전기자 전류의 크기가 변화한다.\n\n④ 역률이 변화함과 동시에 전기자 전류의 크기도 변화한다.\n\n⑤ 계자전류의 조정은 전기자 전류에 영향을 주지 않는다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m27-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m27-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1099}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n다음의 회로에서 2Ω의 저항에 흐르는 전류 A는?\n\n\n\n\n\n                           \n①            ②  \n\n                           \n③            ④  \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m28-q.webp","width":696,"height":717},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m28-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m28-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1019}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n출력이 15kW, 380V, 60Hz인 3상 유도전동기가 있\n\n다. 이 전동기의 2차 입력이 20kW일 때, 2차 효율\n\n은?\n\n\n① 75          ② 80\n\n③ 85          ④ 90\n\n⑤ 95","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m29-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m29-e1.webp","width":696,"height":865}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n교류회로의 역률과 관련된 다음 설명에서 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 임피던스가 Ω인 회로의 역률은 이며,\n\n  전류가 전압보다 늦다.\n\n                     \n② 직렬회로에서 역률은       cos\n\n  이다.\n\n③ 공진회로는 만의 회로와 같으며 역률은 이다.\n\n④ 용량성 회로는 전류가 전압보다 앞서는데 이것을 지상\n\n   (lagging)이라 한다.\n\n⑤ 지상회로에서는 전류의 위상이 전압보다 뒤진다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m30-q.webp","width":678,"height":688},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m30-e1.webp","width":678,"height":688}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n                                        \n다음과 같은 회로의 전달함수가           이고,              \n입력전압이 일 때, 출력전압 V은?\n(단, 의 초깃값은 0이다.)\n\n\n\n\n\n①     ② \n③     ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m31-q.webp","width":678,"height":672},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m31-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1194},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m31-e2.webp","width":696,"height":892}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n                 \n임피던스 함수          의 극점(pole)은?    \n\n\n① ±         ② ± \n\n③ ±         ④ ± \n\n⑤ ± ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m32-q.webp","width":696,"height":599},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m32-e1.webp","width":696,"height":992}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n다음의 회로에서 50Ω의 저항에 흐르는 전류가 88mA \n일 때, 3Ω에 흐르는 전류 mA는?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 16          ② 24\n\n③ 36          ④ 48\n\n⑤ 64","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m33-q.webp","width":696,"height":784},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m33-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1009}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\n                \n함수           를 역라플라스 변환한 는? \n\n\n①     ② \n③     ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m34","number":34},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m34-q.webp","width":696,"height":500},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m34-e1.webp","width":678,"height":873}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q10","number":10,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 35번","searchText":" 35\n\n다음 회로의 단자 , 에서 바라본 등가 합성저항Ω은?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 2           ② 3\n\n③ 4           ④ 5\n\n⑤ 6","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m35","number":35},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m35-q.webp","width":678,"height":697},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m35-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q11","number":11,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 36번","searchText":" 36\n\n다음과 같은 미분방정식을 같은 제어시스템의 입력이 계단\n\n함수 ≧일 때, 출력 는?\n\n     , , \n\n\n①   ②                                \n③   ④                                \n⑤     ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m36","number":36},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m36-q.webp","width":678,"height":703},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m36-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q12","number":12,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 37번","searchText":" 37\n\n\n제어시스템의 상태방정식     에서\n        일 때, 시스템의 안정도를 판별하면?\n        \n\n\n① 안정하다.       ② 불안정하다.\n\n③ 임계안정하다.     ④ 알 수 없다.\n\n⑤ 입력에 따라 다르다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m37","number":37},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m37-q.webp","width":678,"height":483},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m37-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q13","number":13,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 38번","searchText":" 38\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 s에서 스위치 를 닫은 경우\n스위치 로 흐르는 전류 는?\n\n(단, 스위치를 닫기 전에 오랜시간 열려 있었다.)\n\n\n\n\n\n①      ②           \n③      ④           \n⑤   ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m38","number":38},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m38-q.webp","width":696,"height":1073},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m38-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m38-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1883}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q14","number":14,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 39번","searchText":" 39\n\n제어 시스템의 임펄스 응답과 관련한 설명으로 옳지 않은\n\n것은?\n\n\n① 선형 시불변(LTI)시스템에서 단위 임펄스 입력에 대한\n\n  출력을 임펄스 응답이라 한다.\n\n② 회로의 구성(, , )를 알면 단위 임펄스 응답을\n\n  도출할 수 있다.\n\n③ 어떤 입력함수에 대응하는 출력함수를 알면 항상 임펄스\n\n  응답을 도출할 수 있다.\n\n④ 임펄스 응답은 회로의 특성을 시간 영역에서 완전히 나\n\n  타낼 수 있다.\n\n⑤ 임펄스 응답을 알면, 출력함수는 임의의 입력함수와 컨\n\n  볼루션하여 계산할 수 있다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m39","number":39},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m39-q.webp","width":696,"height":809},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m39-e1.webp","width":678,"height":923}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q15","number":15,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 40번","searchText":" 40\n\n근궤적의 특성에서 근궤적의 시작점과 종착점에 관련한 설\n\n명으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 개루프 전달함수의 극점에서 개루프 전달함수의 영점\n\n  또는 무한대로 향한다.\n\n② 개루프 전달함수의 영점에서 개루프 전달함수의 극점으로\n\n  향한다.\n\n③ 폐루프 전달함수의 영점에서 폐루프 전달함수의 극점으로\n\n  향한다.\n\n④ 폐루프 전달함수의 극점에서 폐루프 전달함수의 영점\n\n  또는 무한대로 향한다.\n\n⑤ 허수축에서 시작하여 근궤적의 점근선을 따라 실수축으로\n\n  향한다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m40","number":40},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m40-q.webp","width":678,"height":723},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m40-e1.webp","width":678,"height":959}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q16","number":16,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 41번","searchText":" 41\n\n다음의 상태 방정식으로 표현되는 시스템의 대한 설명으로\n\n옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n                         \n                          \n\n\n\n\n① 시스템은 2차 제어계이다.\n\n② 시스템은 부족제동 상태에 있다.\n\n③ 는 ‘× ’의 벡터이다.\n④ 특성방정식은 이다.\n⑤ 시스템의 고유 주파수는 3rads이다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m41","number":41},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m41-q.webp","width":678,"height":733},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m41-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q17","number":17,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 42번","searchText":" 42\n\n                           \n개루프 전달함수가              일 때,       \n근궤적의 점근선과 실수축이 만나는 점은?\n\n\n① 4           ② 3\n\n③ 2           ④ 1\n\n⑤ -1","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m42","number":42},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m42-q.webp","width":678,"height":427},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m42-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1043}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q18","number":18,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 43번","searchText":" 43\n\n한국전기설비규정(KEC)에 따라 22.9kV의 특고압 가공\n\n전선이 도로를 횡단할 때, 전선의 높이는 몇 m이상으로\n\n해야 하는가?\n\n\n① 4           ② 5\n\n③ 5.5          ④ 6\n\n⑤ 6.5","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m43","number":43},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m43-q.webp","width":696,"height":503},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m43-e1.webp","width":678,"height":839}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q19","number":19,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 44번","searchText":" 44\n\n한국전기설비규정(KEC)에 따라 전선을 접속할 때, 전선의\n\n접속부분의 인장강도는 몇 이상 유지해야 하는가?\n\n\n① 60          ② 70\n\n③ 75          ④ 80\n\n⑤ 90","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m44","number":44},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m44-q.webp","width":696,"height":463},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m44-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q20","number":20,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 45번","searchText":" 45\n\n한국전기설비규정(KEC)에 따라 고압 가공인입선을 시설할\n\n때, 고압 가공전선의 감할 수 있는 높이는 몇 m까지 인가?\n\n\n① 2.5          ② 3\n\n③ 3.5          ④ 4\n\n⑤ 5","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m45","number":45},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m45-q.webp","width":696,"height":464},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m45-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1321}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q21","number":21,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 46번","searchText":" 46\n\n한국전기설비규정(KEC)에 따르면, 변압기에 의하여 특고압\n\n전로에 결합되는 고압전로에는 사용전압의 몇 배이하인 전\n\n압이 가하여진 경우에 방전하는 장치를 그 변압기의 단자\n\n가까은 1극에 설치해야 하는가?\n\n\n① 2           ② 3\n\n③ 4           ④ 5\n\n⑤ 6","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m46","number":46},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m46-q.webp","width":696,"height":454},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m46-e1.webp","width":678,"height":561}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q22","number":22,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 47번","searchText":" 47\n\n한국전기설비규정(KEC)따라 센서등을 설치할 때, 「관광진흥\n\n법」과 「공중위생관리법」에 의한 관광숙박업 또는 숙박업(여\n\n인숙 제외)에 이용되는 객실의 입구등은 몇 분이내에 소등\n\n되는 것이어야 하는가?\n\n\n① 1           ② 2\n\n③ 3           ④ 4\n\n⑤ 5","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m47","number":47},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m47-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m47-e1.webp","width":696,"height":801}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q23","number":23,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 48번","searchText":" 48\n\n한국전기설비규정(KEC)에 따라 태양광설비를 시설할 때,\n\n태양광설비에는 어떤 것을 계측하는 장치를 시설해야 하는가?\n\n\n① 전압과 역률      ② 전압과 주파수\n\n③ 전류와 역률      ④ 전류와 주파수\n\n⑤ 전압과 전력","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m48","number":48},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m48-q.webp","width":678,"height":443},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m48-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1081}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q24","number":24,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 49번","searchText":" 49\n\n한국전기설비규정(KEC)에 따른 퓨즈의 용단 특성에서, 정격\n\n전류가 10A일 때의 용단전류는 정격전류의 몇 배인가?\n\n\n① 1.25         ② 1.5\n\n③ 1.6          ④ 1.9\n\n⑤ 2.1","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m49","number":49},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m49-q.webp","width":678,"height":444},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m49-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1042}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P094-S2-Q25","number":25,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 50번","searchText":" 50\n\n한국전기설비규정(KEC)에 따라 고압 및 특고압 전로에\n\n피뢰기를 설치할 때, 설치장소에 해당하는 것은?\n\n\n① 발전소･변전소의 가공전선 인입구\n\n② 고압 가공전선로에 접속하는 배전용 변압기\n\n③ 특고압 가공전선로에 접속하는 전력용 콘덴서\n\n④ 고압 전선로 중간의 개폐기 접속점\n\n⑤ 지중전선로로 구성된 구간","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m50","number":50},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/